# What a frame underground costs, on the frames a player gets: over the shoulder
# in a hall deep under the lid (GenAbove, no tear within 16 tiles) turning a full
# circle, then the same under an open tear where the day comes down. Each window
# is the `--stats` block (p50/p95/worst); the web build is the one that matters.
#   tools/web.sh --tour=tours/cave-cost.tour --uncapped --timeout=600 --trace --args=--seed=7,--realm=underground,--hour=12,--stats
#   tools/tour.sh tours/cave-cost.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=12 --stats
coast calm
wait 1.0
near deep_under_roof
wait 1.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 2.0
perf stats begin
wait 2.0
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 1.0
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 1.0
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 1.0
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 1.0
perf stats end lidded
shot 01-lidded with shoulder
near shaft_pool
wait 1.5
await shoulder 20
wait 2.0
perf stats begin
wait 2.0
mouse -1280,0 1.2
wait 1.0
mouse 1280,0 1.2
wait 3.0
perf stats end tear
shot 02-tear with shoulder
